sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser
    participant nginx
    participant SCG as api-gateway (Spring Cloud Gateway)
    participant Chat as chat-service (WebFlux)
    participant Gateway as ai-gateway
    participant OpenAI

    Browser->>nginx: GET /api/chats/{id}/stream (EventSource)
    nginx->>SCG: proxy_pass (proxy_buffering off)
    SCG->>Chat: lb://chat-service /chats/{id}/stream (StripPrefix=1)
    Chat->>Gateway: GET /v1/chat/stream (Spring WebClient SSE)
    Gateway->>OpenAI: ChatClient.stream(...)
    loop for each token
        OpenAI-->>Gateway: SSE: {"delta":"…"}
        Gateway-->>Chat: SSE: ChatChunk
        Chat-->>SCG: SSE: ChatChunk
        SCG-->>nginx: SSE: ChatChunk
        nginx-->>Browser: SSE: ChatChunk
    end
    OpenAI-->>Gateway: SSE: [DONE]
    Gateway-->>Chat: complete
    Chat-->>Browser: SSE: end
